{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Mass.Lever1Depth2Exclusion","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Mass.Lever1Depth2Exclusion","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":8,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.Lever1Depth2.depth2_no_fixed_tau","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.Lever1Depth2.depth2_no_fixed_tau","kind":"theorem","line":75,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/Lever1Depth2Exclusion.lean#L75-L91","doc":"**(b)-exclusion of the constant-coefficient depth-2 recurrence.** There is **no** fixed `τ : ℚ`\nfor which the `det = 1` depth-2 recurrence `lw(c) = τ·lw(c−1) − lw(c−2)` holds on the classical\nlever-1 weights at both `c = 3` and `c = 4`: the `c = 3` (seed) equation forces `τ = 21/8`, and then\nthe `c = 4` equation requires `26/5 = 251/48`, false (residual `−7/240`). Hence the lever-1 `lw`\nsequence is **not** the orbit `φ(Mⁿ v₀)` of any window-independent depth-2 kernel — `θ_binding` is a\nseed-fit artifact, not a derived constant-`τ` rate. (`q`-deformation only worsens this: the residual\nrational function is already nonzero at `q = 1`.) ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.Lever1Depth2.lwCl_values","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.Lever1Depth2.lwCl_values","kind":"theorem","line":66,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/Lever1Depth2Exclusion.lean#L66-L73","doc":"The classical lever-1 weights: `lw(1)=1`, `lw(2)=4/3`, `lw(3)=5/2`, `lw(4)=26/5`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.Lever1Depth2.lwCl","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.Lever1Depth2.lwCl","kind":"def","line":62,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/Lever1Depth2Exclusion.lean#L62-L64","doc":"Classical lever-1 weight `lw(c) = (1/(c+1)) · Σ_{λ ⊢ c+1} dim(λ)` (the `q → 1` limit of the\nmean quantum dimension). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.Lever1Depth2.dimSum_values","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.Lever1Depth2.dimSum_values","kind":"theorem","line":57,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/Lever1Depth2Exclusion.lean#L57-L60","doc":"**Computed dimension sums** (dodge-proof, via hook-length `dim`): `Σ_{λ⊢m} dim(λ) = 2, 4, 10, 26`\nfor `m = 2,3,4,5`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.Lever1Depth2.dimSum","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.Lever1Depth2.dimSum","kind":"def","line":54,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/Lever1Depth2Exclusion.lean#L54-L55","doc":"`Σ_{λ ⊢ m} dim(λ)` — the classical dimension sum (computed via hooks). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.Lever1Depth2.partitionsOf","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.Lever1Depth2.partitionsOf","kind":"def","line":45,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/Lever1Depth2Exclusion.lean#L45-L52","doc":"Partitions of `m` for `m = 2..5`, as explicit descending lists (the dimensions are **computed**\nfrom this structure, not tabulated). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.Lever1Depth2.dimOf","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.Lever1Depth2.dimOf","kind":"def","line":41,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/Lever1Depth2Exclusion.lean#L41-L43","doc":"`dim λ = (Σλ)! / ∏ h_c` (hook-length formula; exact `ℕ` division — the HLF guarantees\n`∏ h_c ∣ (Σλ)!`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.Lever1Depth2.hookLengths","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.Lever1Depth2.hookLengths","kind":"def","line":32,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/Lever1Depth2Exclusion.lean#L32-L39","doc":"Hook lengths of a partition `l` (descending rows): cell `(i,j)` has hook `arm + leg + 1`.\nSame construction as `QOU.BraidKnot.WLambdaDefect.hookLengths`; kept local so this file is\nself-contained. ","signatureChunk":0}]}